0,Seko Padang language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seko_Padang_language,"Seko Padang is an Austronesian language spoken in the North Luwu Regency of South Sulawesi, Indonesia. Together with Seko Tengah, Panasuan and Budong-Budong, it belongs to the Seko branch of the South Sulawesi subgroup.",Seko Padang,Austronesian
1,Seko Padang language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/seko_padang_language,"Seko Padang is classified as an Austronesian language belonging to the Malayo-Polynesian branch, more specifically within the South Sulawesi subgroup and the Seko branch of the Celebic group.",Seko Padang,Austronesian
